{"version":1,"content":"<p>鄧麗欣（Stephy）獲邀赴美國出席「夏威夷國際電影節」（HIFF 2026），Stephy攜主演代表作《金都》與即將在港上映的《大分瓶》亮相，並參與電影放映、香港之夜及專場座談會，與當地影迷見面互動，同場還有何超儀與陳子聰攜同電影《拾荒法師》團隊，一同宣揚香港電影文化。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:42:16.475044+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:21:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:38:10.009424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:18.825502+00:00","content_hash":"b0c48b81ba2a6a6ef1bde139eb51d36a8ba4d239457ac128997e2ab0c3be3014","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}